[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2844825196","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105867#issuecomment-2844825196","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105867","id":2844825196,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6pkJZs","user":{"login":"fire","id":32321,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMzIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32321?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire","html_url":"https://github.com/fire","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-01T13:12:59Z","updated_at":"2025-05-01T13:12:59Z","body":"Maybe floating point data is being converted to 8 bit integer data somewhere?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2844825196/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2844882065","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105867#issuecomment-2844882065","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105867","id":2844882065,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6pkXSR","user":{"login":"LunaCapra","id":50772474,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNzcyNDc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50772474?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LunaCapra","html_url":"https://github.com/LunaCapra","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LunaCapra/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LunaCapra/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LunaCapra/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LunaCapra/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LunaCapra/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LunaCapra/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LunaCapra/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LunaCapra/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LunaCapra/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-01T13:50:01Z","updated_at":"2025-05-01T14:11:27Z","body":"After some additional testing I noticed that some of the artifacts are caused by mirrored UVs in the provided mesh.\nHowever, even with a mesh that has no mirrored UVs, the lighting is still not the same as with an equivalent PNG texture.\n|PNG|EXR|\n|---|---|\n|![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/79e22cf1-d1d3-4cb7-9be5-e33366814bcf)|![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/169f4556-f32f-4dcf-b90c-a53832928870)|\n\nThis all seems to be caused by some combination of HDR compression and the normal map option in the import dialog being set to enabled.\nIf HDR compression is enabled, the normal map option being set to enabled makes the texture render as it does in the original post and as seen above.\nWhen the normal map option is set to disabled the problems are reduced drastically but  not removed entirely.\n\nSetting HDR compression to disabled or the texture's compression in general to lossless removes all the rendering artifacts as far as I can tell.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2844882065/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2848716746","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105867#issuecomment-2848716746","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105867","id":2848716746,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6py_fK","user":{"login":"BlueCube3310","id":53150244,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMTUwMjQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53150244?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310","html_url":"https://github.com/BlueCube3310","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-03T17:10:26Z","updated_at":"2025-05-03T17:10:26Z","body":"This looks like an issue with generating mipmaps. Basically, the mipmaps are darker than the original. \n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/eb2c8dad-2ef6-4085-ae2a-ee39143df731)\n\n\nHere is a .dds file with mipmaps compressed with NVIDIA Texture Tools, it looks correct: [bstar.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20024284/bstar.zip)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2848716746/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2849265100","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105867#issuecomment-2849265100","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105867","id":2849265100,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6p1FXM","user":{"login":"fire","id":32321,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMzIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32321?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire","html_url":"https://github.com/fire","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-04T15:01:17Z","updated_at":"2025-05-04T15:01:17Z","body":"Have we seen mip mapping ever work with hdr?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2849265100/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3001438873","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105867#issuecomment-3001438873","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105867","id":3001438873,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6y5lKZ","user":{"login":"rsubtil","id":6501975,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDE5NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6501975?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil","html_url":"https://github.com/rsubtil","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-24T18:12:01Z","updated_at":"2025-06-24T18:12:01Z","body":"Can confirm on `v4.4.1.stable` and latest `master` (987832be460f82206fcac1467e58efbd111c5241).\n\nDisabling HDR compression makes it look correct though:\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ab2cc8ac-cd10-4b6d-8bba-856dd6c07f67)","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3001438873/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3263604681","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105867#issuecomment-3263604681","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105867","id":3263604681,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ChqfJ","user":{"login":"BlueCube3310","id":53150244,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMTUwMjQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53150244?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310","html_url":"https://github.com/BlueCube3310","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-07T09:03:31Z","updated_at":"2025-09-07T09:03:31Z","body":"I think I've figured out the cause - For the base image, we call the `normalize` function in Image, which first unpacks the pixels from a 0.0 <-> 1.0 range to -1.0 <-> 1.0, then normalizes and repacks the value. When generating mipmaps, however, float and half formats are normalized directly, without unpacking. This causes the images to look different","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3263604681/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]